  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 810.01 Remedial Action Plan",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 810.01 Remedial Action Plan. A program participant who elects to continue pursuant to Env-Or 809.02(d) shall submit a remedial action plan that meets the requirements of RSA 147-F:11, VII(b) through (g) and the remedial action plan requirements specified in Env-Or 606.10 to the department.\n\nSource. #8809, eff 1-26-07; ss by #10833, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14421, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or800.html"
